  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b71c93e76664207f17c9ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "359a787ab717105345466cfdeb0d772d5eb45326fca772d8672377cbcf3b1bb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a892649d79dcd651dff06a25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起去苫小牧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af18e5bddefbcaab865a7406c3313fac0cd62aecbc3c28aa48905f80067c052d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20183e9951c0fbb43f0b2414",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南方海洋的话，应该很少见到\n苫小牧特产！不知道能不能有机会\n办个特产展……好想留下一些痕迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4c56a6282d1607fd8ceb6f928fb98fa6f7f2884d87025dd0fbd5f229708b56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492764a917293467b51e39ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不认为会变成那样……\n也不想变成那样……\n但历奇在这一点很让人尊敬啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eeb3f22ee1ca8feab8d42527dba8c929381c233e56434435b5458daea293522",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd996c88c19f30f2f95d97c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道那座城市吗？苫小牧！\r\n充满美食的苫小牧！有趣又丰富！\r\n所以，一起去吧！苫小牧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1347306ab8a0952e5262f3ba22cdc312b561394e6de63903347b858d501c67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68285c6638051cb6a9936c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有从苫小牧赶来的人，\n真的很意外……！\n来自家乡的支持，很令人安心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2929755e2efd31ce738af4171ea4bc036221d8fb86f69dc12cdcc6c26312fa30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dab2b6dcfc93fb2fbc287ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和我一起去度假呗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0136eacf67a1b567ab87c452897ae413da82e47a65e586f938c0194bb1d71cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ab2769ccb537ba33b5dbd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家乡的沙滩，\n果然还是最棒……哇！？\n啊哈，我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a818ed2e8ae3000e15e9d0f80d9f523a83353e85b1f3d846d9f7c17dccbcd310",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee677c027822abfa848fc42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是活用地方偶像经验的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1761d949f1d8d6f814029e45636f79f8c54cecca7c93cd82a764094cdb0f07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e8e501f4121f463d2d1633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苫小牧的大家，看着我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f06afecf2f04a51a7ee4e29eda62f4a325142485ad232ff76f21e1d1e19341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63bce8a7f64fe770369f1d0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同心协力，一起加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5615a70d4f0a1e45b36fbe2ec843d6df45d22dbb6b24b44f03e5052a968c1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c758743ef09e3510a4c94f43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我当时给自己太大的压力，\r\n觉得必须靠自身力量拯救苫小牧。\r\n不过……现在有你与我同心协力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7fc7293fdd9d44f0a923dfdd6b812669214cca592973c4e2bb1f273cb6e2465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80e9e9a6be0b7c6a4b7006e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是学生的基本服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "634c7d4f10eff57cecef73e5105bf5a7491a180046dd9763b4e25ae7eb120543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1eebe8d89f9f60e5a1a95f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣传宣传！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9ef0ba405135b0d0fe54b61017bf6436b14af521ff0915f1c6a1c0b0c6dae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f48ed32be5b0f7254141a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地方偶像，火山！在此登场呗☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "371f58f78709f41a75a6eff3a609488d08103ec2db4314fae1622057b387db09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c6b9f0119eff66f191798f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣着得体，\r\n这就是可爱的秘诀呗☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f315d76b23d804bf82a58b6336b2d9f1c87ca9b24f808d119cd816b0e470b971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5862b9c96af890b78b52e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件服装很可爱……问题在于，\r\n要怎么与苫小牧的宣传做连结……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56ddb8fd8ae308331c590c33470d32d301257fe478174d8150dbaebf57a4325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d9812cb19bc78d21664c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花楸树与天鹅……\r\n满满都是苫小牧的象征呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c376cc66cf3f1d5226704b926e7fad2d13b47745f389d4fcb48b8a7d1ded2a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98de26b82d3489df1d562958",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从苫小牧出发，\n北港火山来了哒呗~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7056aa86eb45e37e1133aa3aa144ed5eeeac68b4cc0c6a77b195d96b3883e78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b4ac77a6954cb6080a67b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地方偶像的话果然还得是\n王道可爱系泳装对吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b3ed48c989fc5b47a75d23735f8f40636214d1e513c23a85bcb014e3252a1ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37480fc9af4fb5f13ad54782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "侬的打扮是不是非常漂亮呀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e374854b283062654270a059a6af9abf47401e168d29d69154d62f03299f17e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f735dddb76cca9a5c9ab14c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这衣服真口爱吶～☆\r\n……嗯～好像有点太装模作样了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad3487996d765743d1b53c8f5217f37d20da3b9ba75ac9aa4d8b13bc5dc65c96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49afb31a9dd37f698b8f7583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息模式，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "387a69fe6cc36864840d56988bd64499584c8b21a8d3875d57e602cd410f1c69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83f59b830d8cb8f1bdec2de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "买衣服的时候\n我们很容易达成共识呢~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94562e9c5b142efbb789d251170b1caae0cb82e6888f9755e27fec8b57a48dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ec67bf5fa0a09f3c40d1f8",
